    "p_value": null,
    "target_engagement_evidence": "Aliskiren markedly suppressed plasma renin activity (PRA ratio 0.09 at single dose peak) and angiotensin I/II, while plasma renin concentration increased (ratio 2.53), consistent with direct renin inhibition. Irbesartan increased PRA (ratio 1.30) and angiotensin I/II, consistent with AT1 receptor blockade.",
